 665:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jquant1.c **** 	/* cur holds the error propagated from the previous pixel on the
 666:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jquant1.c **** 	 * current line.  Add the error propagated from the previous line
