 675:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jquant1.c **** 	 * The maximum error is +- MAXJSAMPLE; this sets the required size
 676:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jquant1.c **** 	 * of the range_limit array.
